person has name "Ada", age 36, langs 0
skills are
    "math"
    "engines"
.
langs of person is skills
convert person to json into text
say text
convert text from json into back
say name of back age of back langs of back
convert skills to json into listText
say listText
convert 42 to json into numText
say numText
convert "a \"quote\" & <tag>" to json into esc
say esc
convert "[1, 2.5, true, null, \"x\"]" from json into mixed
say mixed length of mixed
convert "{\"a\": {\"b\": [1, 2]}}" from json into nested
say nested
